Z||000011||SLYGUY||12-02-2001||01:52 AM||||I love the looks of the '89 too but would of felt silly if tons of people had one. My car wouldn't be the last of the greatest then. <P>Yes, it does look very much like a Fierbird/Trans Am. I just wish that the Fiero wouldn't of gotten such a bad rap. Read the book "Fiero" by Gary Witzenburg. So very much went into this car. I can't complain about the price of my GT though. I bought it for half of what it sold for originally and it looks and runs great!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sly<BR>||||reg||1
